CHAPTER.VERS:
And he answered and said to them, To you

          {+}
         it is given to know the mysteries of the kingdom of heaven, but to them it is not given.

Then hear

          {+}
         the parable of the sower.

But he says, No; lest perhaps while you

          {+}
         gather up the weeds, you

          {+}
         root up the wheat with them.
